def article(slug,title,en,desc,de,key,topic,pairs):
 sources=[dict(label='Primary source',url=U[key]),dict(label='Independent cross-check',url=U[key+'-second'])];path='src/pages/news/'+slug+'.md'
 md(path,dict(layout='../../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro',title=t(title,en),description=t(desc,de),date=NOW,author='LTU Global Education News 編輯部',category=t('國際教育新聞','International education news'),topic=topic,tags=[topic,'Education','2026'],**photo(key),sources=sources),pairs,key)
 news.append(dict(slug=slug,title=title,url='https://globalednews.com/news/'+slug+'/',publishedPath=path,sources=sources,verifiedAt=NOW))
article('memorial-international-enrolment-measures-2026','加拿大Memorial國際生減少：一年與三年降幅不能混讀','Memorial international enrolment: keep one-year and three-year measures separate','AAU初步統計顯示Memorial全時簽證學生年減16.2%；CBC報導全部國際學生三年減約45%，兩者不是同一口徑。','AAU reports a 16.2% annual fall in full-time visa students; CBC reports a roughly 45% three-year decline in all international students.','ca','canada',[
('## 先看統計對象','## Start with the population measured'),('大西洋大學協會10月14日公布、以10月1日為基準的初步調查顯示，Memorial University全時簽證學生由2025年的3,114人降至2026年的2,609人，減少505人、約16.2%。其中大學部為1,232人、研究所1,377人。這是協會的全時統計，不包含所有修課身分。','The Association of Atlantic Universities published its October 1 preliminary survey on October 14. Memorial had 2,609 full-time visa students in 2026, down from 3,114 in 2025: a fall of 505, or 16.2%. The total includes 1,232 undergraduates and 1,377 graduate students. This is a full-time measure, not every enrolment category.'),
('## 為何另一則報導是45%','## Why another report says 45%'),('CBC於10月22日引述校方資料，全部國際學生從2023年的4,889人降至2026年的2,682人，約減45%；報導亦採訪校方註冊主任，指出今年新入學國際生反而增加。總在學生、全時簽證學生與新生是不同群體，不能用一個比例代替另一個，也不能把三年變化寫成一年降幅。','CBC reported on October 22 that all international students fell from 4,889 in 2023 to 2,682 in 2026, roughly 45%. Its interview with the registrar also identified growth in new international entrants this year. Total students, full-time visa students and new entrants are different populations; three-year changes are not annual rates.'),
('## 台灣申請者的選校清單','## A planning checklist for Taiwanese applicants'),('數據反映招生環境變化，不代表個別申請較容易獲簽或錄取。比較Memorial課程時，應分別確認當期學費、課程是否招生、學生支持與實際錄取條件；簽證及就業資格另以政府當期規定核對。本文不把校方希望增加招生的立場當成已放寬規定。','These figures describe recruitment conditions, not an individual admission or visa probability. Check current tuition, program availability, student support and entry requirements separately. A university’s desire to recruit more students does not itself change government rules.')])
article('england-bell-review-school-safeguarding-2026','英格蘭接受Bell檢討27項建議：強化校園反猶歧視通報與培訓','England accepts 27 Bell review recommendations on antisemitism in education','10月21日政府接受學校與學院檢討建議，將推動培訓、通報及指引；接受建議不等於措施已全部落實。','The October 21 response commits to training, reporting and guidance for schools and colleges; implementation remains the next step.','uk','uk',[
('## 已公布的決定','## The announced decision'),('英國教育部10月21日公布對Sir David Bell獨立檢討的回應，接受27項建議，適用討論範圍為英格蘭的學校與學院。政府提出教育領導者培訓、加強學生保護與政治中立指引、改善事件通報，以及協助校方處理複雜個案。不能將此寫成英國所有大學已同時實施的新規。','On October 21, the Department for Education accepted 27 recommendations from Sir David Bell’s review of antisemitism in England’s schools and colleges. Planned measures include leadership training, stronger safeguarding and political-impartiality guidance, better incident reporting and support for complex cases. This is not a new rule already operating at every UK university.'),
('## 落實工作仍需追蹤','## Implementation needs follow-up'),('政府已成立執行小組，並委託Bell於一年後檢視進展。FE Week的獨立報導除核對建議，也引述學院協會觀點：教學工具應考慮學生年齡與情境。接受建議、訂定具體政策與實際執行是不同階段；本文不以少量訪談或問卷推算全國學生遭遇比例。','An implementation group will support delivery, with Bell asked to review progress after one year. FE Week independently reports the recommendations and the Association of Colleges’ call for age- and context-appropriate resources. Acceptance, detailed policy and implementation are separate stages; this article does not extrapolate a national prevalence rate from limited evidence.'),
('## 留學家庭可先核對的支持','## Support that families can check'),('準備赴英格蘭就讀中學或學院的家庭，可詢問校方反歧視政策、事件通報窗口、住宿與心理支持安排。這是編輯部依消息提出的選校檢核，不是新的簽證、招生或獎學金資格。','Families considering schools or colleges in England can ask about anti-discrimination policies, reporting contacts, residential support and counselling. This editorial checklist concerns student support, not a new visa, admission or scholarship entitlement.')])
article('act-school-stoppages-october-2026-followup','澳洲ACT上週分校停工：家庭應核對校方通知，勿沿用過期時段','ACT school stoppages: check current school notices after last week’s action','官方通知涵蓋10月19至23日每天不同學校的一小時停工；10月21日現場報導反映人力爭議，後續全天行動仍須另查。','Official notices covered different schools on October 19–23; subsequent full-day action requires separate confirmation.','au','australia',[
('## 上週行動的範圍','## Scope of last week’s action'),('澳洲首都領地政府通知，公立學校於10月19至23日分校進行上午8時30分至9時30分的一小時停工。各校受影響日期與最低照顧安排不同，部分學校該時段關閉；幼兒園與交通另有說明。這些日期已過，不能當作10月26日起仍適用的停課表。','The ACT Government’s notice covered one-hour stoppages from 8:30 to 9:30 am at different public schools on October 19–23. Minimum supervision and closures varied by school, with separate preschool and transport arrangements. Those dates have passed and must not be presented as the schedule for the week starting October 26.'),
('## 現場報導與待確認事項','## Reporting and unresolved developments'),('Region Canberra於10月21日實地報導教師在Dickson等地的行動，受訪者談及代課、人力與行政負擔；政府則表示持續協商。工會人士提出第四學期可能有全天停工，但這不是已確認的全領地停課日期。本次不推定協商已完成，也不宣稱所有學校都關閉。','Region Canberra reported from the October 21 action in Dickson and elsewhere. Teachers discussed replacement staffing and administrative burdens, while the government described continuing negotiations. A possible later full-day strike is not a confirmed territory-wide closure date. Neither a settlement nor universal school closure is established here.'),
('## 台灣家庭如何安排','## Planning for Taiwanese families'),('在ACT就學或準備短期交流的台灣家庭，應以自己學校最新通知確認報到、監護、交通及活動，避免只轉傳舊新聞日期。本文照片為Dickson College校園資料照，不是本次示威現場。','Taiwanese families studying or arranging exchanges in the ACT should check their own school’s latest attendance, supervision, transport and activity notices. The image is an archive photograph of Dickson College, not the demonstration.')])
def scholarship(slug,title,en,key,amount,ae,deadline,de,pairs):
 assert slug not in r['scholarshipBaselineSlugs'];path='src/pages/scholarships/items/'+slug+'.md';sources=[dict(label='Official award',url=U[key]),dict(label='Independent cross-check',url=U[key+'-second'])]
 fm=dict(layout='../../../layouts/ScholarshipLayout.astro',title=t(title,en),description=t('10月26日查核；台灣學生須符合本文國籍、入學及續領條件，並以正式獎助信為準。','Reviewed October 26; Taiwanese applicants must meet nationality, admission and renewal conditions. The award letter controls.'),date=D,author='LTU Global Education News 編輯部',country=t('美國','United States'),level=t('學士','Bachelor'),funding=t(amount,ae),deadline=t(deadline,de),status=t('開放中','Open'),sourceName='Official award and independent review',officialUrl=U[key],secondSourceUrl=U[key+'-second'],eligibilityTW=t('可申請','Eligible to apply'),taiwanNote=t('台灣籍且符合非美國公民／永久居民及本文其他條件者可申請；不保證得獎。','Taiwanese applicants without US citizenship or permanent residency may apply if all stated conditions are met; awards are not guaranteed.'),verificationDate=D,featuredDate=D,featuredUntil='2026-10-27T00:00:00+08:00',category=t('大學國際生獎學金','International undergraduate scholarships'),**photo(key))
 md(path,fm,pairs,key);sch.append(dict(slug=slug,title=title,url='https://globalednews.com/scholarships/items/'+slug+'/',publishedPath=path,sources=sources,verifiedAt=NOW,eligibleTaiwan=True,open=True,isNew=True,baselineAbsent=True,updateSummary='New independently checked scheme; tiers counted once; no previously published slug.'))
scholarship('2026-10-iowa-state-international-excellence','Iowa State國際Excellence獎助：新生每年最高14,000美元','Iowa State International Excellence: up to USD14,000 annually for first-year students','iowa','學費獎助每年USD 4,000–14,000，依新生或轉學級距','Tuition awards of USD4,000–14,000 per year, depending on entry route','秋季5月1日／春季12月15日前接受錄取','Accept admission by May 1 for fall or December 15 for spring',[
('## 六個級距，計為一個獎助制度','## Six tiers within one award scheme'),('Iowa State對已錄取、按國際生費率繳費的學士新生與轉學生，自動評估International Student Excellence Award，不須另填獎學金表。台灣籍、無美國公民或永久居民身分且符合學歷及英文條件者可走國際申請路徑。本頁將六個級距計為一項，不能拆成多個每日新增。','Iowa State automatically considers admitted international-tuition undergraduates for its International Student Excellence Award. No separate award form is required. Taiwanese applicants without US citizenship or permanent residency can use the international route if academic and English requirements are met. The six tiers count as one scheme.'),
('## 金額與成績條件','## Amounts and academic conditions'),('新生President每年14,000美元、Dean 12,000美元，須SAT／ACT並依官方計算器核對GPA；Innovator為10,000美元、GPA至少3.70，Launchpad為6,000美元、GPA 3.50–3.69，後兩者不要求SAT／ACT。轉學Gold為8,000美元、GPA至少3.70；Cardinal為4,000美元、GPA 3.50–3.69。新生最多8學期、轉學最多6學期，不得將級距相加或與International Merit併領。','Annual first-year tiers are President USD14,000 and Dean USD12,000, requiring SAT/ACT and the official GPA calculator; Innovator USD10,000 at GPA3.70+, and Launchpad USD6,000 at GPA3.50–3.69, without SAT/ACT. Transfer Gold is USD8,000 at GPA3.70+; Cardinal is USD4,000 at GPA3.50–3.69. First-year awards last up to eight semesters and transfer awards six. Tiers and International Merit cannot be combined.'),
('## 目前申請路徑與續領','## Application route and renewal'),('官方入學入口目前可開始申請；獎助本身採持續性的自動評估，秋季須5月1日、春季須12月15日前接受錄取，並非此日期才開放。每學期至少12學分、持續就讀，僅抵學費與費用；President續領GPA至少3.0，其餘至少2.5。不同入學季以錄取信與校方當期要求核對，不把舊版10,000–12,000美元摘要取代目前六級距表。','The official admission entry is available and the award is an ongoing automatic scheme. Accept the offer by May 1 for fall or December 15 for spring. Remain continuously enrolled in at least 12 semester credits; funds cover undergraduate tuition and fees. Renewal GPA is 3.0 for President and 2.5 for other tiers. Confirm term-specific conditions in the offer; older summaries do not supersede the current table.')])
scholarship('2026-10-miami-ohio-presidential-fellows-2027','Miami Ohio Presidential Fellows 2027：學費食宿獎助，須ACT或SAT','Miami Ohio Presidential Fellows 2027: tuition and living support, with ACT/SAT required','pfp','四年學費、費用、食宿及一次USD 5,000學術補助','Four years of tuition, fees, housing and food plus USD5,000 enrichment','2026-12-01 23:59；依校方申請系統時間','December 1, 2026 at 11:59 pm; follow the university application clock',[
('## 適用對象與範圍','## Eligibility and coverage'),('位於俄亥俄州Oxford的Miami University每年遴選15名Presidential Fellows；國際新生可申請，台灣學生須符合國際入學與Honors審查條件。本獎助涵蓋最多四年學費、必要費用、住宿與餐食，另有一次5,000美元學術補助；不等於所有個人開銷全包，保險、書籍、電腦及部分入學費用不在涵蓋範圍。','Miami University in Oxford, Ohio selects 15 Presidential Fellows annually. International first-year applicants, including eligible Taiwanese students, may compete subject to admission and Honors review. The award covers up to four years of tuition, fees, housing and food, plus USD5,000 in academic enrichment. Insurance, books, computers and certain pre-enrolment costs are excluded.'),
('## 2027新增測驗要求','## Testing requirement for 2027'),('官方PFP專頁明確表示，2027秋季申請者必須提供自報ACT或SAT成績。12月1日前備齊所有入學資料，並勾選Honors與Presidential Fellows興趣；不能因一般入學採test-optional就忽略PFP條件。準決選者另補資料，最終面試依邀請於2月在校園進行；不適用春季入學。','The dedicated PFP page explicitly requires self-reported ACT or SAT scores for fall 2027. Complete all required materials by December 1 and indicate Honors/PFP interest. General test-optional admission does not waive this scholarship requirement. Semi-finalists submit additional materials; invited final interviews take place on campus in February. Spring entrants are excluded.'),
('## 續領與查核差異','## Renewal and source reconciliation'),('續領須Oxford校區全時就學、累計GPA至少3.5。部分國際獎助總覽仍列較簡略的時程；本頁以PFP專頁最新測驗與面試要求為準，獨立來源亦提醒該學年測驗規則。請預先估算面試及未涵蓋支出，得獎須以正式通知為準。','Renewal requires full-time Oxford enrolment and a cumulative GPA of at least3.5. The dedicated PFP page provides the controlling testing and interview details; an independent source also flags the cycle’s testing rule. Budget for the interview and excluded expenses, and rely on the official award notice.')])
scholarship('2026-10-miami-ohio-youarewelcomehere-2027','Miami Ohio #YouAreWelcomeHere：兩名國際新生至少50%學費獎助','Miami Ohio #YouAreWelcomeHere: two international awards covering at least half of tuition','ywh','至少50%學費獎助，每年兩名','At least50% tuition; two awards annually','2027-01-01獎助申請；入學申請12月1日優先','January1,2027 scholarship deadline; December1 admission priority',[
('## 台灣學生可申請的條件','## Conditions for Taiwanese applicants'),('Miami University的#YouAreWelcomeHere提供兩名可續領獎助，至少抵50%學費。申請者須為首次學士國際新生，持美國以外國籍且不兼具美國公民或永久居民身分，並展現跨文化學習與交流的主動參與。符合上述條件的台灣學生可申請；已具美國公民或永久居民身分者不適用。','Miami University offers two renewable #YouAreWelcomeHere awards covering at least50% of tuition. Eligible first-year international applicants hold non-US citizenship without US citizenship or permanent residency and demonstrate initiative in intercultural learning and exchange. Taiwanese students meeting these conditions may apply.'),
('## 入學與獎助是兩個步驟','## Admission and scholarship are separate steps'),('先申請Miami入學，12月1日前申請可獲優先考量。錄取後，Applicant Status頁面才提供獎助表，須於1月1日前另行送出；得獎通知預計2月，獲獎者須5月1日前繳交入學訂金。NAFSA主辦的2027名單列有Miami，但其各校共用的春夏期限不是Miami期限。','Apply for admission first, with December1 priority. After admission, the Applicant Status page provides the separate award application, due January1. Award notices are expected in February, with the enrolment deposit due May1 for recipients. NAFSA’s2027 participating list includes Miami; its general spring/summer timeline does not override Miami’s deadline.'),
('## 續領與預算','## Renewal and budgeting'),('續領須Oxford校區全時就讀，累計GPA至少3.0；獎助是學費減免，不保證支付住宿、機票、保險或全部生活費。跨文化作品形式與上傳要求以錄取後的校方表單為準，不能直接假設主辦方的通用影片選項就是校方接受格式。','Renewal requires full-time Oxford enrolment and a cumulative GPA of at least3.0. The award supports tuition and does not guarantee accommodation, travel, insurance or all living costs. Follow Miami’s application form for submission formats rather than assuming every option in the campaign-wide guidance is accepted.')])
